{"id":"wb-7-1298","name":"离堆","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"離堆","text":"离堆位于四川省乐山市市中区，文物遗址年代判定为秦至清。1980年7月7日包括乌尤寺列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。2013年3月5日公布离堆为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n保护范围：以乌尤山山脚为界。建设控制地带：东至乌尤山山脚东侧外延10米；北至乌尤山北侧处延30米；西至岷江西岸与凤洲岛西侧、杜家场南侧连线；南至乌尤山对岸，跨岷江绕麻浩河至乌尤大桥。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%A2%E5%A0%86","revisionId":86588602,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86588602","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/10052bce6e216583695d1ad3.jpg","title":"Lidui_Leshan.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lidui_Leshan.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Lidui_Leshan.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Xin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​乐山离堆（景区入口）","width":320,"height":213}}